# Controls what `vercel` CLI uploads for a local-directory deploy. Deliberately
# NOT the same list as .gitignore: content/generated/ is a regenerated build
# artifact we don't want in git history, but Vercel's build machine has no
# Python/uv to run scripts/precompute.py itself, so it must still be uploaded
# here (see deployment_roadmap.md §9, Phase 5).
node_modules
.next
out
test-results
playwright-report
e2e/.cache
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
.env*
.git
